<</Title (I found a strong cluster of Heptabase material around one core design desire: a native-feeling, Apple-integrated, low-friction personal system that reduces app fragmentation, preserves context across tools, supports quick capture and retrieval, and uses AI/automation without forcing everything into one brittle mega-app. [1][2][3][4])
